# Adding a New Design Variant

## Product
Monoatom Labs — CERAPHENE Graphene Ceramic Coating box packaging.

## Where files live
designs/
  registry.js          <- add your import and entry here
  wrap/<Name>/index.jsx
  back/<Name>/index.jsx
  flaps/<Name>/index.jsx
  qr/<Name>/index.jsx

Read an existing GrapheneV1/index.jsx to understand the props, dimensions, and how SurfaceBg works.


- File path: designs/<panel>/<VariantName>/index.jsx

